UnitMultiEntrypoint::Requires
├── when requiring a bound relay
│   ├── when the relay is not the bound relay
│   │   └── it should revert with WrongRelay
│   └── when the relay matches the bound relay
│       └── it should allow the call
├── when requiring a convertible pair
│   ├── when the convert input is excluded
│   │   └── it should revert with TokenExcluded
│   ├── when the target is not configured
│   │   └── it should revert with NotTargetToken
│   └── when the pair is convertible
│       └── it should allow the call
└── when requiring a non excluded input
    ├── when the compound input is excluded
    │   └── it should revert with TokenExcluded
    └── when the input is allowed
        └── it should allow the call
